WEBVTT

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:22.000
(Listen to the rain Listen to the rain)

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.800
夜色已深
(The night is deep)

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.700
泡一杯茶
(Brew a cup of tea)

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.700
看着窗外
(Looking out the window)

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.400
雨滴落下
(Raindrops falling)

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.300
时间很慢
(Time is very slow)

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.200
世界很静
(The world is very quiet)

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.900
在月光下
(Under the moonlight)

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.500
我的倒影
(My reflection)

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:51.500
放下过去
(Let go of the past Breathe it out)

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:57.500
没有疑问
(No doubts Without a doubt)

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.500
进入梦乡
(Enter dreamland Close your eyes)

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:07.000
满天繁星
(Sky full of stars In the skies)

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:14.500
一场好梦
(A good dream Drift away Drift away)

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:18.500
等待明天
(Waiting for tomorrow)

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:46.000
灯光温暖
(The light is warm)

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:48.800
书本翻开
(The book is opened)

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.800
思绪飘远
(Thoughts drift far)

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:54.800
到了窗外
(To outside the window)

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.000
听着雨声
(Listening to the sound of rain)

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:00.600
洗涤灵魂
(Washing the soul)

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:03.000
这个夜晚
(This night)

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:06.800
无比安稳
(Incredibly peaceful)

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:11.000
放下过去
(Let go of the past Breathe it out)

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:17.000
没有疑问
(No doubts Without a doubt)

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:22.100
进入梦乡
(Enter dreamland Close your eyes)

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:26.500
满天繁星
(Sky full of stars In the skies)

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:44.500
很累了
(Very tired)

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.300
晚安
(Good night)

00:02:56.600 --> 00:03:01.000
做个好梦
(Peace)
